WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:05.360
2022 is shaping up to be a heck of a year
for the world of superheroes — and with

00:00:05.360 --> 00:00:11.780
vampire movies, legal sitcoms, holiday specials,
and plenty of multiverse madness, this is

00:00:11.780 --> 00:00:14.500
Marvel like you've never seen before.

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:17.720
Which project are you looking forward to the
most?

00:00:17.720 --> 00:00:21.759
Although Spider-Man has been on loan to the
MCU for several years, the web-slinger is

00:00:21.759 --> 00:00:26.390
still officially owned by Sony Pictures — as
are his many supporting characters.

00:00:26.390 --> 00:00:30.890
So while Peter Parker has been swinging around
the MCU, Sony has been working on their own

00:00:30.890 --> 00:00:35.879
interlocking cinematic universe of Spider-Man
characters, kicking off with 2018's Venom.

00:00:35.879 --> 00:00:39.609
"Well, you know, I aim to please."

00:00:39.609 --> 00:00:44.090
Joining Tom Hardy's Eddie Brock in the Sony
Spider-verse will be Morbius, based on the

00:00:44.090 --> 00:00:48.350
"living vampire" who first appeared in the
pages of Marvel comics in 1971.

00:00:48.350 --> 00:00:53.610
Morbius will star Jared Leto as Dr. Michael
Morbius — a brilliant biochemist whose attempts

00:00:53.610 --> 00:00:59.269
to cure his own fatal blood disease go predictably
awry, transforming him into a superpowered

00:00:59.269 --> 00:01:02.820
ghoul who must consume human blood to survive.

00:01:02.820 --> 00:01:07.471
Joining Leto in the film will be Adria Arjona
as Martine, the female lead of the film, while

00:01:07.471 --> 00:01:12.430
Doctor Who star Matt Smith will be serving
as the main antagonist, Loxias Crown.

00:01:12.430 --> 00:01:16.730
Also appearing in Morbius will be Michael
Keaton, most likely reprising his role as

00:01:16.730 --> 00:01:22.300
Adrian Toomes from Spider-Man: Homecoming,
which would make Morbius the first full crossover

00:01:22.300 --> 00:01:25.420
between the MCU and Sony's Spidey films.

00:01:25.420 --> 00:01:29.580
Daniel Espinosa will direct from a script
by Lost in Space co-creators Matt Sazama and

00:01:29.580 --> 00:01:30.690
Burk Sharpless.

00:01:30.690 --> 00:01:34.470
Morbius will hit theaters on January 28, 2022.

00:01:34.470 --> 00:01:39.840
The sequel to 2016's Doctor Strange has been
in development since before that flick even

00:01:39.840 --> 00:01:45.140
hit theaters, and in 2019 it was revealed
that the sequel will be titled Doctor Strange

00:01:45.140 --> 00:01:47.220
in the Multiverse of Madness.

00:01:47.220 --> 00:01:52.200
The movie will co-star Elizabeth Olsen as
Wanda Maximoff, appearing hot off the heels

00:01:52.200 --> 00:01:53.270
of WandaVision.

00:01:53.270 --> 00:01:57.140
Most of the previous movie's cast will be
returning, joined by Xochitl Gomez, who will

00:01:57.140 --> 00:02:00.530
be playing the dimension-hopping superhero
America Chavez.

00:02:00.530 --> 00:02:05.020
Otherwise known as Miss America, Chavez is
notable for being one of Marvel's most well-known

00:02:05.020 --> 00:02:07.280
LBGTQ+ characters.

00:02:07.280 --> 00:02:12.450
The creative team for the second Strange film
changed in two big ways during production.

00:02:12.450 --> 00:02:17.870
Firstly, Evil Dead and Spider-Man director
Sam Raimi stepped in for original director

00:02:17.870 --> 00:02:21.760
Scott Derrickson when Derrickson departed
the project due to creative differences with

00:02:21.760 --> 00:02:22.760
Marvel.

00:02:22.760 --> 00:02:26.480
Raimi will also be reuniting with composer
Danny Elfman, who's taking over scoring duties

00:02:26.480 --> 00:02:29.260
from Doctor Strange composer Michael Giacchino.

00:02:29.260 --> 00:02:33.410
Considering the MCU is revisiting Raimi's
Spider-Man movies as part of Spider-Man: No

00:02:33.410 --> 00:02:38.710
Way Home, it really does feel like Raimi was
destined to return to the Marvel universe.

00:02:38.710 --> 00:02:42.840
The multiverse goes mad on May 6th, 2022.

00:02:42.840 --> 00:02:48.460
Given his fantastic character arc over his
last several appearances, nobody was particularly

00:02:48.460 --> 00:02:53.170
surprised to hear that Thor would be the first
Avenger to receive a fourth solo film.

00:02:53.170 --> 00:02:57.400
Thor: Ragnarok's Taika Waititi will be returning
to direct Thor: Love and Thunder, which will

00:02:57.400 --> 00:03:00.680
also see the return of Natalie Portman's Jane
Foster.

00:03:00.680 --> 00:03:05.350
Apparently, Foster will follow in her character's
recent comic book footsteps by picking up

00:03:05.350 --> 00:03:08.610
Mjolnir to become Thor herself.

00:03:08.610 --> 00:03:13.210
Returning Thor stalwarts include Jaimie Alexander
as Lady Sif and Tessa Thompson as Valkyrie,

00:03:13.210 --> 00:03:16.180
while Chris Pratt will also be joining the
cast as Star-Lord.

00:03:16.180 --> 00:03:21.490
Meanwhile, basically every other Guardian
has also been spotted on-set in Australia,

00:03:21.490 --> 00:03:25.630
making the whole team's involvement more or
less a dead certainty.

00:03:25.630 --> 00:03:30.610
Serving as the antagonist for Love and Thunder
will be Christian Bale as Gorr the God Butcher,

00:03:30.610 --> 00:03:35.310
a character who, in the comics, is obsessed
with killing gods and absorbing their power.

00:03:35.310 --> 00:03:40.160
A number of other A-listers are set to appear,
including Matt Damon, Sam Neill, and Luke

00:03:40.160 --> 00:03:44.190
Hemsworth, who you may recall playing “Thor”
opposite Damon’s “Loki” in Ragnarok.

00:03:44.190 --> 00:03:48.600
This time, they'll be joined by Melissa McCarthy,
who will be playing yet another Asgardian

00:03:48.600 --> 00:03:49.600
actor.

00:03:49.600 --> 00:03:52.930
Russell Crowe is also set to star as the Greek
god Zeus.

00:03:52.930 --> 00:03:54.620
How will this all come together?

00:03:54.620 --> 00:03:56.440
Well, that's anyone's guess.

00:03:56.440 --> 00:04:01.890
But we'll know for sure when Thor: Love and
Thunder hits theaters on July 8th, 2022.

00:04:01.890 --> 00:04:07.150
Despite raking in billions of dollars among
them, none of the live-action Spider-Man films

00:04:07.150 --> 00:04:12.090
managed to do what Into the Spider-Verse did:
score an Academy Award.

00:04:12.090 --> 00:04:17.609
The Best Animated Feature of 2018 is considered
by some to be among the greatest superhero

00:04:17.609 --> 00:04:24.159
films ever made, with a supremely innovative
animation style and a novel focus on its eclectic

00:04:24.159 --> 00:04:27.330
cast of alternate-universe Spider-People.

00:04:27.330 --> 00:04:32.479
Spider-Verse was so singular a cinematic achievement
that it seems like its success would be impossible

00:04:32.479 --> 00:04:36.259
to duplicate — but that's not going to stop
Sony from trying.

00:04:36.259 --> 00:04:40.139
The Spider-Verse sequel will center on the
burgeoning romantic relationship between Miles

00:04:40.139 --> 00:04:41.729
Morales and Gwen Stacy.

00:04:41.729 --> 00:04:46.270
In 2019, it was also reported that the film
will take place two years after the events

00:04:46.270 --> 00:04:47.379
of the first film.

00:04:47.379 --> 00:04:52.189
Additional plot details are still a mystery,
but a teaser shared by the official Spider-Verse

00:04:52.189 --> 00:04:58.659
Twitter account features 17 different spider
logos, indicating that, once again, a variety

00:04:58.659 --> 00:05:02.850
of Spider-People will arrive from across the
multiverse.

00:05:02.850 --> 00:05:06.879
"This could literally not get any weirder.”

00:05:06.879 --> 00:05:11.650
This would be in keeping with what Sony Pictures'
Amy Pascal said when she told Vanity Fair

00:05:11.650 --> 00:05:15.490
that Into the Spider-Verse 2 will feature
more female versions of Spidey.

00:05:15.490 --> 00:05:19.800
On that note, it has also been revealed that
Issa Rae will be joining the cast as Jessica

00:05:19.800 --> 00:05:22.960
Drew — better known as Spider-Woman.

00:05:22.960 --> 00:05:28.650
Expect to see yet more versions of the web-slinger
when Into the Spider-Verse 2 arrives on October

00:05:28.650 --> 00:05:30.879
7th, 2022.

00:05:30.879 --> 00:05:37.219
After the tremendous success of 2018's Black
Panther, a sequel seemed like a foregone conclusion.

00:05:37.219 --> 00:05:42.150
Sure enough, in the fall of 2018, The Hollywood
Reporter announced that Black Panther 2 was

00:05:42.150 --> 00:05:47.560
officially happening, with original writer-director
Ryan Coogler returning to write and direct.

00:05:47.560 --> 00:05:50.840
Chadwick Boseman was also expected to reprise
his role as T'Challa.

00:05:50.840 --> 00:05:56.110
Tragically, in August 2020, Boseman passed
away following a four-year struggle with cancer.

00:05:56.110 --> 00:06:01.139
The news came as a shock to Boseman's fans
and colleagues alike, as the actor had kept

00:06:01.139 --> 00:06:05.089
his condition and treatment quiet, even as
he continued to work.

00:06:05.089 --> 00:06:09.680
While Marvel declined to comment on the future
of Black Panther immediately following Boseman's

00:06:09.680 --> 00:06:14.130
death, Black Panther: Wakanda Forever is now
confirmed to be moving forward, with a release

00:06:14.130 --> 00:06:17.059
date of November 11th, 2022.

00:06:17.059 --> 00:06:21.509
Executive producer Victoria Alonso has confirmed
that Wakanda Forever will not be using a digital

00:06:21.509 --> 00:06:25.819
double to stand in for Boseman, leading many
to speculate that someone else will take up

00:06:25.819 --> 00:06:27.750
the mantle of Black Panther.

00:06:27.750 --> 00:06:32.650
Much of the first movie's cast will be returning,
joined by Marvel newcomer Tenoch Huerta, who

00:06:32.650 --> 00:06:37.080
will be playing one of the film's antagonists,
as well as Michaela Coel in an undisclosed

00:06:37.080 --> 00:06:38.080
role.

00:06:38.080 --> 00:06:41.389
Additionally, Wakanda Forever will serve as
the introduction to the character of Riri

00:06:41.389 --> 00:06:46.389
Williams, played by Dominique Thorne, who
will later be headlining her own Disney+ series.

00:06:46.389 --> 00:06:50.849
Although further details for Wakanda Forever
are still scarce, there can be little doubt

00:06:50.849 --> 00:06:55.839
that the sequel's story and its characters
will find an appropriate and satisfying way

00:06:55.839 --> 00:06:57.639
to honor their king.

00:06:57.639 --> 00:07:02.149
While most of Marvel's Disney+ shows seem
to exist to help further the overarching plot

00:07:02.149 --> 00:07:07.680
of Phase Four and beyond, one title doesn't
seem all that interested in epic crossovers

00:07:07.680 --> 00:07:09.690
or sprawling narratives.

00:07:09.690 --> 00:07:15.330
That's right — The Guardians of the Galaxy
Holiday Special is coming to Disney+ in 2022.

00:07:15.330 --> 00:07:19.180
"Welcome to the frickin' Guardians of the
Galaxy."

00:07:19.180 --> 00:07:22.969
So what can fans expect from a holiday-themed
MCU special?

00:07:22.969 --> 00:07:27.930
One may need to look no further than the much-maligned
Star Wars Holiday Special, which Guardians

00:07:27.930 --> 00:07:32.659
writer and director James Gunn says he "unironically
loved" as a kid.

00:07:32.659 --> 00:07:37.620
Gunn has said in the past that he's had an
idea for a Guardians holiday special for years,

00:07:37.620 --> 00:07:40.069
adding that it's one of his favorite stories
ever.

00:07:40.069 --> 00:07:44.740
While he hasn't offered up any clues about
what this story actually looks like, Gunn

00:07:44.740 --> 00:07:49.210
has assured fans that The Guardians of the
Galaxy Holiday Special will be crazy and fun;

00:07:49.210 --> 00:07:55.039
he has also clarified that it will be live-action
and will bring back all of the main Guardians

00:07:55.039 --> 00:07:56.039
cast.

00:07:56.039 --> 00:08:00.059
Gunn also confirmed that the special will
be considered MCU canon, being set between

00:08:00.059 --> 00:08:03.490
Thor: Love and Thunder and Guardians of the
Galaxy Vol. 3.

00:08:03.490 --> 00:08:07.710
Further, Gunn has claimed in a tweet that
the special will introduce someone who, in

00:08:07.710 --> 00:08:13.909
his opinion, is one of the greatest MCU characters
of all time" — although who that could be

00:08:13.909 --> 00:08:15.659
is anyone's guess.

00:08:15.659 --> 00:08:18.559
All shall be revealed, however, in late 2022.

00:08:18.559 --> 00:08:22.581
She-Hulk is based on the character of the
same name, who was first introduced in the

00:08:22.581 --> 00:08:23.960
comics in 1980.

00:08:23.960 --> 00:08:27.740
In the comic book universe, Jennifer Walters
is a promising young attorney who is shot

00:08:27.740 --> 00:08:29.810
and wounded by a vengeful mobster.

00:08:29.810 --> 00:08:34.469
To save her life, she receives a blood transfusion
from the only match available: her cousin,

00:08:34.469 --> 00:08:35.469
Bruce Banner.

00:08:35.469 --> 00:08:40.819
His gamma-irradiated blood has a predictable
effect, but as She-Hulk, Walters retains her

00:08:40.819 --> 00:08:43.300
personality and lawyerly intellect.

00:08:43.300 --> 00:08:48.029
The series pilot will be directed by Kat Coiro,
who will also direct several other episodes

00:08:48.029 --> 00:08:50.310
and serve as executive producer.

00:08:50.310 --> 00:08:54.190
Jessica Gao, best known for her work on Rick
and Morty, will be heading up the writers

00:08:54.190 --> 00:08:55.190
room.

00:08:55.190 --> 00:08:58.520
Jennifer Walters will be played by Orphan
Black star Tatiana Maslany, joined by Mark

00:08:58.520 --> 00:09:01.260
Ruffalo, who is reprising his role as Bruce
Banner.

00:09:01.260 --> 00:09:05.380
Also featured is Tim Roth, who returns as
the villainous Abomination.

00:09:05.380 --> 00:09:10.009
That character debuted in The Incredible Hulk
before making a cameo appearance in Shang-Chi

00:09:10.009 --> 00:09:12.110
a full 13 years later.

00:09:12.110 --> 00:09:16.490
Meanwhile, The Good Place star Jameela Jamil
will be starring as the villainous Titania,

00:09:16.490 --> 00:09:19.920
while Ginger Gonzaga is set to play Jennifer's
best friend.

00:09:19.920 --> 00:09:24.350
Expect to see this new Marvel series hit Disney+
in 2022.

00:09:24.350 --> 00:09:29.470
Marvel's first Muslim superhero will be getting
a spotlight on Disney+ with the upcoming series

00:09:29.470 --> 00:09:30.839
Ms. Marvel.

00:09:30.839 --> 00:09:35.180
Fans were delighted when news about the show
broke in 2019, as Kamala Khan's adventures

00:09:35.180 --> 00:09:38.930
have been hugely popular ever since her introduction
in 2013.

00:09:38.930 --> 00:09:43.459
Portraying the teen superhero will be newcomer
Iman Vellani, who, before this, was known

00:09:43.459 --> 00:09:47.709
for her work as part of the Next Wave Committee
at the 2019 Toronto Film Festival.

00:09:47.709 --> 00:09:51.670
Referring to Kamala's ability to change the
shape and size of her body, the character's

00:09:51.670 --> 00:09:53.880
creator G. Willow Wilson told Polygon:

00:09:53.880 --> 00:09:56.880
"She's got very comic booky powers.

00:09:56.880 --> 00:10:01.259
God bless them trying to bring that to live
action; I don't know how that's going to work

00:10:01.259 --> 00:10:04.480
out in a way that doesn't look really creepy."

00:10:04.480 --> 00:10:08.610
Joining Vellani in Ms. Marvel will be The
Walking Dead's Matt Lintz as Kamala's best

00:10:08.610 --> 00:10:13.180
friend, Bruno Carrelli, as well as relative
Hollywood newcomer Laurel Marsden as Kamala's

00:10:13.180 --> 00:10:15.220
best frenemy, Zoe Zimmer.

00:10:15.220 --> 00:10:19.310
Ms. Marvel is set to premiere on Disney+ in
summer 2022.

00:10:19.310 --> 00:10:23.930
Marvel fans have been waiting for years to
see Moon Knight make his on-screen debut,

00:10:23.930 --> 00:10:26.220
and now it's finally happening.

00:10:26.220 --> 00:10:30.900
Helmed by Egyptian filmmaker Mohamed Diab,
along with indie filmmaking team Justin Benson

00:10:30.900 --> 00:10:35.710
and Aaron Moorhead, Moon Knight will follow
Marc Spector, a former Marine and mercenary

00:10:35.710 --> 00:10:38.250
who is left for dead on a covert mission in
Egypt.

00:10:38.250 --> 00:10:43.000
He is then spared and healed by the Egyptian
god Khonshu — in exchange for Spector becoming

00:10:43.000 --> 00:10:45.670
his earthly avatar of justice.

00:10:45.670 --> 00:10:50.210
Considered by some to be Marvel's answer to
Batman, there's one distinct facet of the

00:10:50.210 --> 00:10:54.589
character that sets Moon Knight apart from
DC's Dark Knight: his struggle with Dissociative

00:10:54.589 --> 00:10:56.040
Identity Disorder.

00:10:56.040 --> 00:11:00.610
Moon Knight employs a number of his multiple
personalities to assist him in his crime-fighting

00:11:00.610 --> 00:11:05.870
activities, and recent comic runs have even
suggested that his powers might not be real

00:11:05.870 --> 00:11:07.000
at all.

00:11:07.000 --> 00:11:10.720
Oscar Isaac will be stepping into the role
of Marc Spector for Moon Knight, fresh off

00:11:10.720 --> 00:11:15.310
his three-film stint as Poe Dameron in the
Star Wars sequels and a stunning turn as Leto

00:11:15.310 --> 00:11:16.910
Atreides in Dune.

00:11:16.910 --> 00:11:21.769
Joining Isaac in undisclosed roles will be
Ramy star May Calamawy and Oscar-nominated

00:11:21.769 --> 00:11:23.310
actor Ethan Hawke.

00:11:23.310 --> 00:11:26.200
Speaking to The Wrap about his work on Moon
Knight, Hawke said:

00:11:26.200 --> 00:11:28.540
"With Moon Knight, people don't know much
about it.

00:11:28.540 --> 00:11:30.850
It doesn't have a lot of baggage.

00:11:30.850 --> 00:11:35.681
Oscar [Isaac] is giving an absolutely phenomenal
performance, and it feels exciting to be a

00:11:35.681 --> 00:11:36.940
part of it with him."

00:11:36.940 --> 00:11:41.779
We'll learn just how Hawke fits into the world
of Moon Knight when the series hits Disney+

00:11:41.779 --> 00:11:43.610
sometime in 2022.

00:11:43.610 --> 00:11:45.790
Check out one of our newest videos right here!

00:11:45.790 --> 00:11:49.140
Plus, even more Looper videos about the Marvel
Universe are coming soon.

00:11:49.140 --> 00:11:52.570
Subscribe to our YouTube channel and hit the
bell so you don't miss a single one.

